01:03:34.480 --> 01:03:39.800
stories and he's a super cool guy, so definitely worth having

01:03:39.800 --> 01:03:43.200
him on. But I think this, to maintain a

01:03:43.200 --> 01:03:48.440
long, long career in flying, you have to have a very, very deep

01:03:48.440 --> 01:03:50.920
love of flying. I think that's the core

01:03:53.200 --> 01:03:55.120
teaching. Paragliding is another thing.

01:03:56.080 --> 01:04:01.040
I think most, most paragliding instructors have 10 years in

01:04:01.040 --> 01:04:04.920
them, and after 10 years they become jaded.

01:04:04.920 --> 01:04:07.120
They've said it all before. They've been through the whole

01:04:07.120 --> 01:04:12.320
process before, and they lose that spark that made them a good

01:04:12.320 --> 01:04:14.600
instructor five years previously.

01:04:15.560 --> 01:04:17.960
I certainly was was was that case.

01:04:17.960 --> 01:04:21.440
I was a reasonably OK instructor in my mid 20s.

01:04:21.440 --> 01:04:24.720
By the time I stopped teaching, I probably wasn't as good as I

01:04:24.720 --> 01:04:27.160
was before. Because you just become a bit

01:04:27.320 --> 01:04:30.800
annoyed with it, you know, because you're talking about

01:04:30.800 --> 01:04:33.000
flying much more than you are actually flying.

01:04:34.520 --> 01:04:39.000
So it's hard to have a long career in paragliding because

01:04:39.000 --> 01:04:41.400
it's hard to, it's a small, it's a difficult business, a

01:04:41.400 --> 01:04:45.200
difficult industry to work in because you're, you're not

01:04:45.200 --> 01:04:50.040
working, you're working with people who are your friends and

01:04:50.040 --> 01:04:53.560
everybody knows everybody. And it's difficult to do

01:04:53.560 --> 01:04:56.720
business with friends you know especially well.

01:04:56.720 --> 01:04:59.240
You'll find out when you do. Guiding means that you'll get

01:04:59.240 --> 01:05:01.880
repeat customers, repeat customers who become friends and

01:05:01.880 --> 01:05:05.640
then you don't want to charge them as much as you did before.

01:05:05.640 --> 01:05:09.240
And it all, it's a difficult industry to work in really.

01:05:09.240 --> 01:05:10.760
Like I've always thought, but I've not.

01:05:10.760 --> 01:05:12.520
It's the only industry I've ever worked in.

01:05:13.880 --> 01:05:16.040
There's something about it which is inexplainable.

01:05:16.040 --> 01:05:20.480
And in case the audiences are wondering, the the mention about

